window.products.push({"id":407116,"name":"YELLOW Sunflowers Bush Satin Artificial Flowers 19\" Bouquet 11-4664 YL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618llISjTCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These are artificial silk flowers. The flowers can be used for decoration in all events such as Anniversary, Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, Sweet 16 celebration, and they are perfect making wedding bouquets, corsages, boutonnieres, centerpieces and more. * Picture shows 1 bush, you get 1 bush, each bush 18\" tall tip to tip approximately, materials used are Faux Silk, Plastic, Wires, INDOOR use only * Each bush has 11 flowers, flower dimensions are approximately 4.0\" W x 1.25\" H * Each bush has 11 stems which are approximately 10\" - 13\" long included flower height and made of steel wires covered with plastic or floral tape which make them easy to bend or shape to the way you like * Due to packing, may need to use hair dryer or cloth steamer to FLUFF & ARRANGE product for it looks as pictures * Due to monitor color setting, COLOR may not be EXACT as pictures or seeing in person. Buy \"IN PERSON\" if exact color is absolute necessary  **** WE COMBINE SHIPPING ****","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618llISjTCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Phoenix Silk","source_asin":"B015P3T0IE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-407116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015P3T0IE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015P3T0IE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":407117,"name":"Nestl Bed Sheet Set – Easy Care – 1800 Collection Microfiber - Flex Top King Size - Beige Cream","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812MKTkv9hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wake Up to a Brighter Tomorrow The search is over! Say goodbye to restless, sweaty nights and usher in a new era of peaceful, refreshing sleep.Our luxurious sheets are tightly woven and double brushed on both sides, contributing to a silky soft feel and ensuring that our100% microfiber sheets are softer and more durable than Egyptian cotton sheets, organic cotton sheets or 1800 thread count sheets! Pet Friendly No worries about pet nails and claws!Our bedding is less likely to tear or snag, even when you share your bed with your pets.So go ahead, build a pillow fort and snuggle inside with your best friend.Lightweight, breathable and cool to the touch, our dreamy, soft bedding will create an unforgettable sleeping experience!Upgrading your bedroom décor has never been so easy and affordable! Easy Use and Care Unlike other fitted sheets, our sheets have elastic all around the entire sheet for a secure fit that won’t shift around while you sleep!No need for sheet grippers or additional corner straps because our sheets will stay secure throughout the night, letting you sleep more peacefully. Machine washable bedding is a dream come true for allergy sufferers, allowing you to keep your bedding free from dust, pet dander and other allergens.In addition, the tightly-woven fibers of our bedding prevent dust from accumulating in the first place!Pet hair, fur and dander can be removed easily through washing and will not cling to the material. Machine wash in cold water. Tumble dry on low and remove promptly. Nestl Into Happiness We created Nestl to bring you soft, beautiful bedding at fair prices.As pioneers at the forefront of the bedding industry, we are proud to present you with affordable, high-quality bedding, crafted from premium microfiber material and made to last. Nestle between our silky soft bedding for a sleep so sublime, you’ll wonder if you’re dreaming!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812MKTkv9hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nestl","source_asin":"B0761356LD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-407117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0761356LD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0761356LD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
