window.products.push({"id":407122,"name":"Nambe Twist Champagne Flutes, Pair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31VMa+a0c0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Usher elegance into your home or make a statement at your wedding with the Twist Flute, standing as tall and expectant as your favorite bottle of champagne. The combination of the full-lead crystal tulip-inspired bowl and the metal twisting stem will leave you as captivated as the champagne you consume. Wash by hand and dry immediately for the best results. Amazon.com The stunning Twist collection of stemware is a daring creation of Nambé designer Fred Bould. Imparting his love of water and motion and the spiraling helix shape, each stemmed glass melds a combination of two materials: a perfectly smooth crystal bowl and a metal alloy stem that twists to create light and shadow. The two Twist Champagne flutes in this pair stand an impressive 11 inches tall, utterly dynamic and graceful. Not only do the stems provide textural pleasure but release from worries about breakage. The full-lead crystal bowls, crafted by skilled European artisans, hold up to eight ounces of champagne and sparkle brilliantly. After use, the glasses should be washed by hand and dried immediately to prevent spotting. Nambé Twist stemware comes gift-boxed and ready to delight. Nambé was founded in 1951 in a village of the same name in scenic northern New Mexico. From the beginning, the company focused on hand-producing high-quality, functional items such as sand-cast metal bowls and trays with great attention to timeless, modern design. Porcelain tableware also now joins Nambé crystal and metal lines, all of which make exceptional gifts for the most special of occasions. Nambé ware has won numerous design awards, has been shown in or recognized by nearly two dozen museums worldwide, and is part of the permanent collections of many, including the Museum of Modern Art in New York. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31VMa+a0c0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B0009DO0F4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-407122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009DO0F4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009DO0F4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
