window.products.push({"id":407190,"name":"VEVOR 110V Commercial Dough Mixer 15kg, Kneading Capacity 30 QT, Flour Mixer 1500W, with Visible Lid, Heavy-Duty Pizza Dough Mixer 304 Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s5PjJdVwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel StructureThe commercial mixer is constructed with full heavy-duty food-grade stainless steel material, with a sleek appearance. Durable, sturdy, and easy cleaning. Visible Transparent WindowThe visible skylight design can effectively prevent dust from falling into the barrel and can observe the inner working conditions in real-time. Dough-Kneading ImitationThe upgraded thickened twisted dragon-shaped mixer, with precise welding, can effectively simulate the manual dough kneading. The two-way button can change the rotating directions. All-Copper MotorThe 1500-watt high-power pure-copper motor allows a large kneading capacity of 30 QT (15 kg) to be mixed at one time, greatly improving the efficiency of dough mixing. Well-Designed DetailsOur commercial dough mixer adopts upgraded double gear design, largely enhancing the efficiency of dough mixing; The reinforced components make the machine more stable. Efficient Dough-MixingThe multi-functional dough mixer can be used for mixing dough or stirring muddy meat. It is suitable for making all kinds of bread, buns, dumplings, pizza, noodles, etc.SpecificationsPower: 1500W Kneading Capacity: 30 QT (15 kg) Product Weight: 132.3 lbs (60 kg) Product Dimensions: 26.4\"x20.5\"x27.6\"(670x520x700 mm) Package Content1 x Dough Mixer 1 x Scraper 1 x Dumpling Forming Tool 1 x Egg White Separator 1 x Measuring Cylinder 1 x Cleaning Sponge 1 x Food Clip","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s5PjJdVwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B08C72431H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-407190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C72431H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C72431H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
