window.products.push({"id":407341,"name":"NEWGATE® M Mantel Silent Sweep Mantel Clock - 'No Tick' - A Modern Tabletop Clock - Small Clock - Living Room Clock - Office Clock - Desk Clock - Mini","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kiTRN3hAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Newgate Clocks are proudly designed in the UK A contemporary mantel or desk clock with a minimalist dial. Available in a range of monochrome colour options, this modern matt-finish mantel clock holds a graphic dial and glass lens. Known as ‘silent sweep’ in the industry, the hands move in a constant sweeping motion rather than a stepped tick. So you won’t hear any ticking but if your hearing is particularly sensitive in a completely silent room you may hear a very quiet whirring. Size: HWD 6.6 x 6.3 x 2.4in. Materials: Acrylic case with a silicone finish, metal hands and glass lens. Movement: Quartz ‘silent-sweep’ movement. Power: Requires 1 x high quality branded alkaline AA battery (not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kiTRN3hAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEWGATE","source_asin":"B0B434GQ6D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-407341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B434GQ6D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B434GQ6D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
