window.products.push({"id":407838,"name":"Brieftons QuickSlice Spiralizer: Vegetable Spiral Slicer, Best Veggie Pasta Spaghetti Maker for Low Carb/Paleo/Gluten-Free Meals","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sDEb8SB1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✓ YOUR SPIRALIZING KIT with NEW, SUPERIOR DESIGNS: Made from high quality plastic and stainless steel, the QuickSlice has all the power and versatility of a traditional countertop spiralizer, but is easier, quicker, safer to use and clean, and much more compact when stored away. It comes with 4 built-in blade modes, all easily adjustable via a knob. No more bulky loose blades taking up precious kitchen space or causing accidental injuries. No more valuable time wasted swapping blades in and out. ✓ Lifetime Hassle-Free Full Replacement Warranty ✓ SUPERIOR VALUE: Bundle includes the Brieftons QuickSlice Spiralizer with 4 blade modes adjustable via a knob, printed user manual, easy online quick-start guide with our demo videos, the exclusive Brieftons Spiral Slicer Recipe ebook, the Brieftons Guide to Summer Salad Recipes ebook, and The Benefits of Raw Foods ebook with exclusive recipes you can make using your spiralizer right away, plus outstanding Brieftons customer support. ✓ TOP QUALITY & DESIGN: Built to last with 4 built-in 420-grade stainless steel blades, and BPA-free food grade, reinforced ABS plastic. Safety blade cover prevents finger injuries. Small coring blade for minimal veggie wastage and better support for narrow veggies. Easy to use and clean, with strong suction cups for stability & removable components for thorough cleaning. Small footprint when deassembled (only about one third of the size of traditional countertop spiralizers when stored away) ✓ HIGHLY VERSATILE: Perfect for making low carb, healthy veggie noodles quickly from firm fruits and veggies like apple, onion, carrot, zucchini, cucumber, cabbage, beetroot, turnip, rutabaga, cucumber, radish, potato, sweet potato, squash etc. The small coring blade results in minimal vegetable wastage, and allows for both narrow (e.g. carrot, cucumber) and wide veggies to be spiralized with equal ease. Use the 4 adjustable blade modes to create 3mm, 6mm, 12mm or flat wide noodles effortlessly. ✓ HOW DOES IT HELP YOU? Enjoy your meal, even if you are on a diet (raw, vegan, low carb, gluten-free, no wheat, Paleo). Replace high carb pasta with healthy & tasty vegetable equivalents ✓ A PERFECT GIFT FOR ALL OCCASIONS: What else can make a better gift for your loved ones than this gift of health | BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: We are the trusted spiralizer brand with thousands of happy customers. You are covered by our Lifetime Hassle-Free Full Replacement Warranty for your utmost peace of mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sDEb8SB1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brieftons","source_asin":"B01J1ONZRK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-407838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J1ONZRK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J1ONZRK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":407839,"name":"MSZFE12NA/MUZFE12NA - Mitsubishi Mr.Slim 12,000 BTU 23 SEER Heat Pump Hyper Heating Single Zone Ductless Mini Split Air Conditioner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GvFQb5dIL._AC_.jpg","description":"What's Included - One Mitsubishi Ductless Heat Pump Outdoor Unit ( MUZFE12NA ) - One 12,000 btu Mitsubishi Ductless Heat Pump Indoor Unit ( MSZFE12NA ) - One Indoor unit mounting plate - One Wireless LCD Remote Control - 7 Year Compressor warranty, 5 Year parts warranty - Installation Instructions Mitsubishi Mr.Slim 23 SEER Mini Split Ductless Heat Pump Mitsubishi Mr.Slim mini split-ductless air conditioning heat pump systems have been the quiet solution for cooling and heating problems around the world. Our quiet and powerful Mitsubishi Mr.Slim systems have three main components: an indoor unit, outdoor unit, and remote controller. The Mitsubishi Mr.Slim M-Series is the ideal ductless solution for homes and light commercial applications. Our new Ultra Efficiency models use Inverter technology which results in performance improvements of 40 – 60% over conventional fixed compressor speed systems. These new models also feature Catechin Anti-allergy Filters (combats germs, bacteria, viruses and bad odors), additional air flow control features (Wide Air Flow, Auto Change-over, Powerful Mode), 20% quieter operation, R410A refrigerant and even longer piping allowances for installation. All of our M-Series ductless wall mounted systems are lightweight, compact, stylish and blend into the smallest of spaces. These systems only require a small opening to connect the indoor unit to the outdoor unit which makes installation a breeze! Mitsubishi Mr.Slim systems are also much more attractive and more secure than traditional window units. One of the main reasons that Mitsubishi Electric is the industry leader in ductless air conditioning is that our advanced innovations have led the industry for years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GvFQb5dIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mitsubishi","source_asin":"B007A7K4SO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-407839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007A7K4SO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007A7K4SO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
