window.products.push({"id":407862,"name":"ExtraCharm Insulated Lunch Bag for Women/Men - Reusable Lunch Box for Office Picnic Hiking Beach - Leakproof 12-Can Coke Cooler Tote Bag Organizer wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pWGOORuzL._AC_SL1495_.jpg","description":"EXCELLENT THERMAL INSULATED: ExtraCharm lunch bag adopts three-layer heat insulation design: the outer layer is durable 300D Oxford cloth and polyester fiber, the inner layer is Eco-friendly EVA material, and the middle layer is specially filled with 5mm thick insulating pearl foam. Our reusable lunch box can keep the food cold/hot/fresh for hours, which is perfect for on-the-go meals, picnics, road trips, beaches, as well as to have lunch in the office, outdoors! LEAKPROOF & EASY TO CLEAN: The lunch bag is made of ultra-thick EVA soft lining and hot-welded seams without any needle holes to prevent leakage. The lunch bag is easy to clean. If the sauce spills inside, please wipe it off with a damp cloth or napkin. With heavy-duty Oxford cloth and superb tailoring technology, the adult lunch bag is dustproof, waterproof, durable and keep your food clean. LARGE CAPACITY & MULTI COMPARTMENTS: The insulated lunch bag is 10 x 6.7 x 8 inches, enough to store 12 cans of cola (330 ml), and the main zipper compartment is designed to provide you with lunch and hot/cold/fresh drinks. The front zipper pocket can store keys, cards, napkins and phone chargers. Two mesh pockets for water bottles and an inner mesh bag for knives, forks and spoons are perfect for packing all food and snacks all day long. CONVENIENT & PORTABLE: This reusable lunch bag has a firm handle and a removable and adjustable shoulder strap. It can be easily carried with one hand, or it can be firmly tied to a backpack or briefcase. The modern and lightweight design is very suitable for women, men and adults. It can be used as a lunch bag, insulation bag, picnic bag, food container, sundries bag or shopping bag. IDEAL GIFT CHOICE: High-quality reinforced metal SBS double zipper can ensure smooth opening, wide mouth design for deposit and withdrawal. Our ExtraCharm tote bag is a wonderful gift for Thanksgiving, Christmas for family and friends. It’s also an ideal gift for Mother’s Day and Father’s Day. If you are not satisfied with the reusable lunch box, please feel free to contact us for a solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pWGOORuzL._AC_SL1495_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ExtraCharm","source_asin":"B0B9WV9JXZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-407862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9WV9JXZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9WV9JXZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
